          "author": "L.M. Montgomery",
          "description": "Eleven-year-old orphan Anne Shirley has red hair, a vivid imagination and cannot stop talking. Quite a shock for old Matthew and Marilla Cuthbert who wanted a boy to help them on the farm… Anne is soon the talk of the town with her funny ways and endless adventures, but it is not long before she has won the hearts of everyone. This abridged classic story is set in Canada at the beginning of the twentieth century and is one of the most enduring favourites of children’s literature.",
